  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="d7a25650-5023-4902-8bb2-fe8c31fd3f77"><problem><para>
      <para>Which of the following is equivalent to \(10^2−12^2\)?</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((10 + 12)(10 + 12)\)</para><para>\((10 − 12)(10 − 12)\)</para><para>\((10 −12)^2\)</para><para>\((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
